Utilization Observatory

Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs

Utilization Observatory is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for explaining where accelerator capacity is actually going across execution, stalls, memory, transfers, residency, retries, fragmentation, reservations, and idle or stranded states.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Utilization Observatory does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry is
written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Utilization Observatory accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on the
terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
